README.md:38:| `TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY` | Canonical base64 of exactly 32 cryptographically random bytes for AES-256-GCM; identical across instances. A placeholder/password is invalid. Key loss prevents decryption; rotation/migration is not implemented. |
